  "question": {
    "text": "A particle is projected from the ground and simultaneously a wedge starts moving towards the right, as shown in the figure. The maximum height of the wedge for which the particle will not hit the wedge is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>ms</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math><br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" height=\"143\" src=\"assets\\qt0043_b7dadc49d985.jpg\" width=\"283\" />"
  },
